   * The model is NOT the authority on escalation. It reports what it sees;
     the Python rule matrix decides. Saying so here reduces the chance of a
     confidently wrong escalation that Python then has to override.
   * "I do not have enough information" is presented as a correct answer, so
     the model has somewhere to go other than guessing.
